  { key: 'negotiation', prompt: `${CONTEXT}\n\nDIMENSION: negotiation economics & claims correctness. Check offers.py (supplier_value usage, price solving, levels/menu, must_beat, anchor_price incl. should-cost floor and price_unit), graph.concession_values (monotonicity, reciprocity, late schedule), policy.route closing rules vs cost/score formula in brief/api.md (accept/walk logic, final_offer push, reservation vs alternative), and claims.py against the claim-check rules in brief/api.md 'What counts' (idx windows <=12 months ending within last 12 months, tolerance, sc mean semantics, po same part, quote/offer rules, doc+ctr notice, irrelevant if about another supplier, duplicates once per case except rival quotes once per supplier). Find cases where the agent leaves money on the table systematically, sends sheets worse than standing offer, cites data that would be contradicted/irrelevant, or misprices.` },
